  "prompt": "A pharmacy adherence program tracks prescription refills to identify patients' medication compliance patterns. Write a query that returns, for each patient, every refill record along with the date of their very first refill and the date of their very last refill in the dataset. The output should show: `patient_id`, `prescription_id`, `refill_date`, `first_refill_date` (earliest refill date for that patient across all prescriptions), and `last_refill_date` (latest refill date for that patient across all prescriptions). Order the results by `patient_id`, then by `refill_date`. Note: some patients may have only one refill on record, in which case first and last dates will be identical.",
